  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/mysticalagradditions?source=modrinth\"></span></p>\n<p><a title=\"Mystical Agriculture\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blakesmods.com/img/banner/mysticalagriculture_required.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display: flex;\" align=\"left\"><a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/mystical-agradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/downloads&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/mystical-agradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right: 8px;\" href=\"https://blakesmods.com/mystical-agradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/mysticalagradditions/mc_version&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"https://blakesmods.com/wiki/mysticalagradditions\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&amp;message=查看&amp;color=brightgreen&amp;style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本模组为<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mystical-agriculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">神秘农业</a>添加了更多内容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>特色内容</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">第6级精华：无尽精华！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">新增高阶材料对应的6级作物，包括下界之星、觉醒龙锭、中子素等！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多功能工具：集镐、斧、铲功能于一体</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">匠魂联动内容！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精华煤炭：比普通煤炭能熔炼更多物品</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>资源作物</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><em>最后更新版本：7.0.2</em></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>原版资源：</strong>下界之星、龙蛋</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>植物魔法：</strong>盖亚魂核</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>龙之进化：</strong>觉醒龙锭</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><em>无尽贪婪：</em></strong><em>中子素</em></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><em>能量艺术：</em></strong><em>硝化晶体</em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/blakesmods\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/fdf1b29a-987b-450e-b6d4-a16c2da8aadf.png\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></span></p>",
